<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Goodrich.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Goodrich.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded B.F. Goodrich Co to long-term buy from accumulate, keeping its near-term rating at accumulate.</p>
</text>
